stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> RAW_BYTES
  RAW_BYTES --> SIGNATURE_REJECTED: invalid / missing / misbound signature
  RAW_BYTES --> VERIFIED_INSTALLATION: valid bounded signature
  VERIFIED_INSTALLATION --> MALFORMED_REJECTED: envelope or schema cannot parse
  VERIFIED_INSTALLATION --> UNSUPPORTED_VERSION_QUARANTINED: adapter/schema not allowlisted
  VERIFIED_INSTALLATION --> BINDING_RESOLUTION: signed context only

  BINDING_RESOLUTION --> UNKNOWN_BINDING_QUARANTINED: no unique verified historical binding
  BINDING_RESOLUTION --> AMBIGUOUS_BINDING_QUARANTINED: multiple bindings or unprovable cutover
  BINDING_RESOLUTION --> RECEIPT_RESERVED: exactly one historical school binding

  RECEIPT_RESERVED --> REPLAY_RECORDED: same stable identity and verified digest
  RECEIPT_RESERVED --> IDENTITY_CONFLICT: same identity, different verified digest
  RECEIPT_RESERVED --> ROUTED_TO_REVIEW: new eligible resolved occurrence
  RECEIPT_RESERVED --> RETRY_AMBIGUOUS_RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED: durable prior outcome cannot be proven

  UNSUPPORTED_VERSION_QUARANTINED --> [*]
  UNKNOWN_BINDING_QUARANTINED --> [*]
  AMBIGUOUS_BINDING_QUARANTINED --> [*]
  RETRY_AMBIGUOUS_RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED --> [*]
  REPLAY_RECORDED --> [*]
  IDENTITY_CONFLICT --> [*]
  ROUTED_TO_REVIEW --> [*]

  note right of UNKNOWN_BINDING_QUARANTINED
    No school queue or candidate unless
    independent stored evidence proves one school.
    Default without approved operator plane: reject.
  end note

  note right of AMBIGUOUS_BINDING_QUARANTINED
    Never route by current mapping, label,
    externalId, default account, or selector.
  end note

  note right of ROUTED_TO_REVIEW
    2xx only after this bounded durable outcome
    is committed. It is not CRM creation.
  end note
